2025-10-08 12:29:00,820 [WARNING] Skipped idx=437: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The study identified and measured the expression of all five N-terminal isoforms of p73, including TAp73, DeltaNp73, DeltaN'p73, Ex2p73, and Ex2/3p73. Among these, TAp73, DeltaNp73, and DeltaN'p73 were significantly upregulated in tumors. The overexpression of these isoforms was observed to have a range that was age-dependent, with the most pronounced differences in the youngest age group. Correction for this age effect was crucial in further survival correlations.'
