2025-10-08 12:29:00,875 [WARNING] Skipped idx=452: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The context specifies that there are two different isoforms of the p73 gene: TAp73 and DeltaNp73. TAp73 is the transcriptionally active form, while DeltaNp73 is the dominant negative form. The relative ratio of these isoforms is crucial in determining cell fate, with TAp73 promoting apoptosis and DeltaNp73 inhibiting it. PIR2, a ring finger domain ubiquitin ligase, is induced by TAp73 and degrades DeltaNp73, thereby increasing the TA/DeltaNp73 ratio and enhancing the pro-apoptotic effects of TAp73. Based on this information, the number of TAp73 isoforms identified in humans, as per the context, is two.'
